          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Concentration of the peroxy radical ISOPN, one of the ten members of CBM-Z's lumped peroxy-peroxy pool. A consumer that integrates the mechanism drives this from the reaction system's own ISOPN; standalone it is a parameter, which is what makes the rate coefficients testable pointwise."
