          "description": "Concentration of the peroxy radical ISOPO2, one of the ten members of CBM-Z's lumped peroxy-peroxy pool. A consumer that integrates the mechanism drives this from the reaction system's own ISOPO2; standalone it is a parameter, which is what makes the rate coefficients testable pointwise."
