          "description": "Half-rate weight of ISOPN in the peroxy pool, sqrt(A) exp(B/2T) with the self-reaction coefficients A = 3.099999979481495e-14, B = 1000.0 of cbmz_mosaic.def's Aperox/Bperox diagonal (A is a single-precision literal there, so it is bound as the binary64 value of its float32 rounding)."
        },
        "g_isopo2": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "cm^1.5/molec^0.5/s^0.5",
          "description": "Half-rate weight of ISOPO2 in the peroxy pool, sqrt(A) exp(B/2T) with the self-reaction coefficients A = 3.099999979481495e-14, B = 1000.0 of cbmz_mosaic.def's Aperox/Bperox diagonal (A is a single-precision literal there, so it is bound as the binary64 value of its float32 rounding)."
        },
        "g_xo2": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "cm^1.5/molec^0.5/s^0.5",
          "description": "Half-rate weight of XO2 in the peroxy pool, sqrt(A) exp(B/2T) with the self-reaction coefficients A = 3.099999979481495e-14, B = 1000.0 of cbmz_mosaic.def's Aperox/Bperox diagonal (A is a single-precision literal there, so it is bound as the binary64 value of its float32 rounding)."
        },
        "s_perox": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "molec^0.5/cm^1.5/s^0.5",
          "description": "Weighted concentration of the whole peroxy pool, S = sum_j g_j c_j. Every one of the ten lumped peroxy-peroxy rate coefficients is 2 g_i S minus its own self-term correction, so the pool is summed once."
        },
        "dk_perox_cross_ch3o2_ro2": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "cm^3/molec/s",
          "description": "Correction to the CH3O2 <-> RO2 cross coefficient. cbmz_mosaic.def's peroxy() builds every off-diagonal pair from the diagonal by A_ij = 2 sqrt(A_ii A_jj), B_ij = (B_ii + B_jj)/2, then OVERRIDES this one pair with A = 1.3000000381735433e-12 (a single-precision literal), B = 640.0. This is the difference between the override and the combination rule, added to k_R127 and k_R129 with the partner's concentration."
        },
        "k_R001": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/s",
          "description": "Rate coefficient of CBM-Z reaction 1 {001:J01} NO2 + hv = NO + O3P (cbmz_mosaic.eqn: j(Pj_no2))."
